<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ SoT: Structured-of-Thought Prompting Guides Multilingual Reasoning in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.6 </span>Details of Extracted Knowledge and Relations</span></a></li>
